              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رنجیدن (ranjidan) — \"to take offence; to be hurt\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او از شوخی دوستش رنجید. u az shukhi-ye dustash ranjid. He was hurt by his friend's joke."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present stem ranj-: miranjad 'takes offence'. The noun ranj means 'suffering, toil'."
            }
          ]
